message: 'To cite package "crate" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'crate: Canonical Schema and Data Governance for New Graph Environment'
version: 0.4.0
abstract: 'Source-explicit dispatcher and declarative schemas for canonicalizing heterogeneous
  data inputs across the New Graph Environment ecosystem. Ships canonical-shape schemas,
  decision logs, and adapter functions that insulate downstream consumers (link, fresh,
  reporting repos) from upstream-shape variability. First instance: bcfishpass override
  CSVs.'
